  <Callout kind="remember">
    A result is one plain column target per reel, addressed by cell
    coordinate with 0 at the top of the window. The builder expands it into
    a full strip once per reel per result, random-filling first and placing
    the target on top, and the reel then eats that strip one id per wrap as
    it stops. Everything the server did not name is a weighted random draw
    you can shape with pools, set before the spin.
  </Callout>
